The fonts of the folders tfm, type1 and virtual fall under the LaTeX
Project Public License (see the file LATEX_LICENSE). The original fonts can
all be downloaded from CTAN (http://www.ctan.org).

The fonts of the folder truetype are not covered by this notice: each of its
subfolders holds the license of its fonts (the SIL Open Font License for
Fira, the GPL with the font exception or the OFL for Libertine, the GUST
Font License for TeX Gyre, the STIX Font License, the license of
OpenDyslexic).

Some of the Type 1 fonts were automatically generated by Joris van der Hoeven
using the 'autotrace' program. Except for the file extensions, all file names
are the same as those of the original fonts. For instance, the file ecrm12.pfb
was generated from ecrm12.mf. The original fonts can be downloaded from
CTAN (http://www.ctan.org).
